# The raw results ARE committed — decision 8 of the S9 plan: committing the data
# is what lets a reader recompute a number they doubt instead of taking it, and
# it is the only thing that saves EVALS.md from the charge that it was written
# on the last day to match the gates.
#
# Only the throwaway harness-proof run is ignored: `--in-process --out
# evals/results/fake` exists to show the harness reports failure before any
# money is spent, and its verdicts are meaningless.
results/fake/
